# Web client scope

Work here is a **consumer** of `scripts/ask` and the retrieval index. Do not edit
`corpus/`, `schemas/`, or `review/`.

Use `clients/web/package.json` scripts (`dev`, `typecheck`, `test`), not the root corpus
gate. See [clients/web/AGENTS.md](../../clients/web/AGENTS.md) and
[clients/web/README.md](../../clients/web/README.md).

This package is not a Convex app. Do not add `convex/` or Convex deployment patterns here.
